'''Minions''' are item generators constantly active on the {{Zone|Private Island}} regardless of whether or not the island is loaded.

== Overview ==
'''Minions''' are item generators that are constantly active on the {{Zone|Private Island}}. They interact with the {{Green|5x5}} area around them by placing and breaking [[Blocks]], or spawning and killing [[Mobs]]. By default, only {{Green|5}} of them can be placed at a time, but this limit can be increased by gaining [[Minions#Minion Slots|Minion Slots]]. Most minions also give [[Skills|Skill XP]]. The tier of a minion determines its base storage capacity and speed, both of which can be increased using [[Minions#Minion Modifiers|Minion Modifiers]].

The {{Zone|Private Island}} starts with a Tier I {{Item|Cobblestone Minion}}, which starts with {{Item|Cobblestone|20}}.

Minions cannot be sold on the {{Zone|Auction House}}, but they can be traded through [[Trading]].

=== Minion Interface ===
{{Minion UI|Cobblestone Minion}}

The left of the '''Minion Interface''' consists of {{Green|1}} [[Minion Skin]] slot, {{Green|1}} [[Minion Fuel]] slot, {{Green|1}} [[Automated Shipping]] slot, {{Green|2}} [[Minion Upgrade]] slots, and up to {{Green|15}} Storage slots. 

* The Redstone Torch icon can be clicked to view the minion’s most efficient layout.
* The Minion Head icon can be used to view general information about the minion, including the time between its actions, its max storage, and its items generated.
* The Gold Ingot icon can be used to view how the minion would change if it was upgraded, and can be clicked to view the crafting recipe for the next tier minion.
* The Chest icon can be clicked to pick up all items stored inside the minion.
* The Diamond icon can be used to upgrade the minion's tier (provided all the crafting materials are in the [[mcw:Inventory|Inventory]].
* The Bedrock icon can be used to pick up the minion, converting it to item form, and picking up all upgrades and generated items stored inside.

=== Minion Collection Experience ===
When collecting items from '''Minions''' or their storage, the [[Co-op]] will be rewarded with [[Skills|Skill Experience]]. Skill Experience from minions is affected by [[Wisdom]]. If the Co-op’s minions are collected while offline, XP will be received the next time the {{Zone|Private Island}} is visited.

== Minion Slots ==
'''Minion Slots''' refer to the number of minions that can have placed on the {{Zone|Private Island}} at the same time, and are shared between the [[Co-op]]. By default, this number is {{Green|5}}, but it can be increased up to {{Green|32}} by crafting more unique tiers of minions and purchasing [[Account & Profile Upgrades#Minion Slots|Minion Slots]] from {{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}}.

