=== Crafted Minions ===
{{Main|Crafted Minions}}
The '''Crafted Minions''' menu can be accessed through the [[Collections|Collection Menu]], {{Code|/craftedgenerators}}, or {{Code|/craftedminions}}. It displays all the unique minions the [[Co-op]] have crafted. The Minion Head icon at the top displays how many unique minions have been crafted, how many minion slots have been unlocked, and how many unique minions needed until the next minion slot can be unlocked. With each new type of minion unlocked, one of the gray dye icons will be replaced with an icon of that minion type, with a list of each tier unlocked listed in green and each tier yet to be unlocked listed in red.

