== Tips ==
{{See also|Tutorial:Minion Farming}}
* [https://hypixel.net/threads/spreadsheet-skyblock-minions-v1-61-bazaar-api-update.2166857/ SkyBlock Minions Spreadsheet] - Extensive spreadsheet detailing everything about individual '''Minion''' profits from the [[Bazaar]] and [[NPCs]].
* A '''Minion''' with a {{Item|Super Compactor 3000}} or {{Item|Dwarven Super Compactor}} will turn items into their enchanted forms, even if the player has not unlocked the enchanted recipe of the item yet.

== Trivia ==
* '''Minion tiers''' can be distinguished by a colored patch on their heads.

