* Increasing a '''Minion's''' level sometimes upgrades its held item.
* '''Minions''' used to have colored names.
* If a '''Minion''' does the same action twice, it slightly decreases the efficiency of the minion.
* In [[The Catacombs - Floor IV]] and above, the [[Quiz]] puzzle has a question about the amount of unique minions.
* The '''Pickup Minion''' button used to be able to make bugged-stacks of items like a stack of {{Item|Ender Pearl|64}}.
* On [[wp:April Fools' Day|April Fool's Day]], '''Minions''' appear as regular-sized {{Item|Armor Stand}}s.
* Mobs killed by '''Minions''' drop their base drops as item entities, the minion picks them up after a few seconds. In that short time that the item entities exist, the player or a hopper can pick them up, causing the minion to not get them.
* There used to be a bug where putting a '''Minion''' in a {{Item|Chest}} had a small chance of turning it into a [[mcw:Steve|Steve]] or [[mcw:Alex|Alex]] head.
* There used to be a bug where '''Minion''' heads could be placed directly on {{Item|Hard Glass}}.

